@startuml design-2c-dominio-lancamentos
!include estilo.iuml
hide circle
hide empty members
hide <<ref>> members
hide <<ref>> stereotype
hide <<foco>> stereotype
title GastoCerto — Design (vista 2c): lançamentos (domain.model)

abstract class Entry {
  + id : String
  + amount : Money
  + date : LocalDate
  + description : String
  + accountingMonth : MonthYear
  + originId : String?
  + status : EXPECTED | ACTUAL {readOnly}
  + confirm(actualAmount : Money)
}
class Expense {
  + paymentMethod : PaymentMethod
  + thirdParty : Person?
  + conversion : CurrencyConversion?
  + isThirdParty() : Boolean
}
class Installment {
  + purchaseId : String
  + number : Int
  + totalInstallments : Int
  + label() : String
}
class Income {
  + type : SALARY | ONE_OFF | INVESTMENT_SALE
}
class InstallmentPurchase <<foco>> {
  + id : String
  + totalAmount : Money
  + installmentCount : Int
  + purchaseDate : LocalDate
  + description : String
  + card : CreditCard
  + thirdParty : Person?
  + {static} INSTALLMENT_RANGE = 2..48
  + generateInstallments() : List<Installment>
}
class CurrencyConversion {
  + originalAmount : Long
  + exchangeRate : Long
  + toBrl() : Money
}
class Reimbursement {
  + id : String
  + thirdParty : Person
  + amount : Money
  + date : LocalDate
}
class PaymentMethod <<ref>>
class CreditCard <<ref>>
class Person <<ref>>

Entry <|-- Expense
Entry <|-- Income
Expense <|-- Installment
Expense "0..*" --> "1" PaymentMethod : paymentMethod
Expense "0..*" --> "0..1" Person : thirdParty
Expense "1" *-- "0..1" CurrencyConversion
InstallmentPurchase "1" *-- "2..48" Installment : cria >
InstallmentPurchase --> "1" CreditCard
Reimbursement --> "1" Person

note right of InstallmentPurchase
  <b>Creator + Information Expert</b>: gera N parcelas
  em competências consecutivas a partir da 1ª (RN01),
  rotuladas k/N; resto dos centavos na 1ª [RN02].
  Não tem tabela própria: as parcelas guardam purchaseId [D5]
end note
note bottom of CurrencyConversion
  originalAmount em centavos da moeda; exchangeRate com
  4 casas; toBrl = valor × cotação ÷ 10.000 [RN05 · D1]
end note
note bottom of Entry
  originId: id da recorrência que gerou o EXPECTED;
  evita duplicar no fechamento do mês [D3]
end note
legend left
  Cinza = detalhada em outra vista (2b)
endlegend
@enduml
